        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "Yellow cards are common in soccer games."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "But red cards are quite rare."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "So, what is the record for most red cards in one game?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "In 2011, there was a soccer game in Argentina."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "In this game, the referee gave an incredible 36 red cards!"
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "Two players got red cards in the first half."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "In the second half, a big"
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "fight started."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "Because of the fight, all the other players got red cards."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "Even some other team members got red cards, too."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
